<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMANY AND CROATIA TIED 2-2 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMANY AND CROATIA TIED 2-2 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany and Croatia were tied 2-2 after the last singles of their Fed Cup semifinal on Sunday:</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Anke Huber (Germany) beat Iva Majoli (Croatia) 4-6 7-6 (7-2) 6-0</p>
<p>Mirjana Lucic (Croatia) beat Meike Babel (Germany) 6-4 6-1</p>
</text>
